      "observed": "R1 is specified as 10 ohms and is connected between VCC and the Q1 gate node Net-(Q1-G), which is also driven by the collector of Q2.",
      "expected": "R1 should be a high-value pull-up, typically around 10 kΩ, so that Q2 only pulls the P-MOSFET gate low without creating a large continuous current path from VCC through R1 and Q2 to ground.",
      "evidence": [
        {
